    "Simulator OS runtime. Manage removal in Xcode > Settings > Components (Platforms on older Xcode). Simulators Xcode can still run, and their data, are not cleaned automatically." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "نظام تشغيل المحاكي. أدِر الإزالة في Xcode > Settings > Components (Platforms في إصدارات Xcode الأقدم). المحاكيات التي لا يزال Xcode قادرًا على تشغيلها وبياناتها لا تُنظَّف تلقائيًا."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Runtime del sistema operatiu del simulador. Gestiona’n l’eliminació a Xcode > Configuració > Components (Plataformes en versions antigues de Xcode). Els simuladors que Xcode encara pot executar, i les seves dades, no es netegen automàticament."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Simulator-Laufzeit des Betriebssystems. Verwalte das Entfernen in Xcode > Settings > Components (Platforms in älteren Xcode-Versionen). Simulatoren, die Xcode noch ausführen kann, und ihre Daten werden nicht automatisch bereinigt."
          }
        },
        "en-AU" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Simulator OS runtime. Manage removal in Xcode > Settings > Components (Platforms on older Xcode). Simulators Xcode can still run, and their data, are not cleaned automatically."
          }
        },
        "en-CA" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Simulator OS runtime. Manage removal in Xcode > Settings > Components (Platforms on older Xcode). Simulators Xcode can still run, and their data, are not cleaned automatically."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Simulator OS runtime. Manage removal in Xcode > Settings > Components (Platforms on older Xcode). Simulators Xcode can still run, and their data, are not cleaned automatically."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Runtime del sistema del simulador. Gestiona su eliminación en Xcode > Settings > Components (Platforms en Xcode más antiguos). Los simuladores que Xcode aún puede ejecutar, y sus datos, no se limpian automáticamente."
          }
        },
        "es-419" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Runtime del sistema del simulador. Gestiona su eliminación en Xcode > Settings > Components (Platforms en Xcode más antiguos). Los simuladores que Xcode aún puede ejecutar, y sus datos, no se limpian automáticamente."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Runtime de système du simulateur. Gérez le retrait dans Xcode > Réglages > Composants (Plateformes sur les anciennes versions de Xcode). Les simulateurs que Xcode peut encore exécuter, et leurs données, ne sont pas nettoyés automatiquement."
          }
        },
        "gsw" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Simulator-OS-Runtime. S Entferne verwaltisch du i Xcode > Settings > Components (bi älterem Xcode: Platforms). Simulatore, wo Xcode na cha uusfüere, und ihri Date werded nöd automatisch ufgruumt."
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "सिम्युलेटर OS रनटाइम। हटाना Xcode > सेटिंग > कंपोनेंट (पुराने Xcode पर प्लेटफ़ॉर्म) में प्रबंधित करें। जिन सिम्युलेटर को Xcode अब भी चला सकता है, और उनका डेटा, अपने आप साफ़ नहीं किए जाते।"
          }
        },
        "hr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Runtime OS-a simulatora. Uklanjanjem upravljaj u Xcode > Settings > Components (Platforms u starijem Xcodeu). Simulatori koje Xcode još može pokrenuti i njihovi podaci ne čiste se automatski."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Runtime del sistema operativo del simulatore. Gestisci la rimozione in Xcode > Impostazioni > Componenti (Piattaforme nelle versioni precedenti di Xcode). I simulatori che Xcode può ancora eseguire, e i loro dati, non vengono puliti automaticamente."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "シミュレータのOSランタイム。削除は Xcode > Settings > Components(古いXcodeではPlatforms)で管理します。Xcodeがまだ実行できるシミュレータとそのデータは、自動ではクリーンアップされません。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "시뮬레이터 OS 런타임. 제거는 Xcode > 설정 > 구성요소(이전 Xcode에서는 플랫폼)에서 관리하세요. Xcode에서 아직 실행할 수 있는 시뮬레이터와 그 데이터는 자동으로 정리되지 않습니다."
          }
        },
        "lv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Simulatora OS izpildlaiks. Noņemšanu pārvaldi sadaļā Xcode > Settings > Components (vecākā Xcode — Platforms). Simulatori, ko Xcode vēl var palaist, un to dati netiek tīrīti automātiski."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Środowisko uruchomieniowe systemu symulatora. Zarządzaj usuwaniem w Xcode > Settings > Components (Platforms w starszym Xcode). Symulatory, które Xcode nadal może uruchomić, i ich dane nie są czyszczone automatycznie."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Runtime do SO do simulador. Gira a remoção em Xcode > Settings > Components (Platforms em versões mais antigas do Xcode). Os simuladores que o Xcode ainda consegue executar, e os seus dados, não são limpos automaticamente."
          }
        },
        "sq" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Runtime i sistemit operativ të simulatorit. Menaxho heqjen te Xcode > Settings > Components (Platforms në Xcode më të vjetër). Simulatorët që Xcode mund t'i ekzekutojë ende, dhe të dhënat e tyre, nuk pastrohen automatikisht."
          }
        },
        "sr-Cyrl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Окружење оперативног система симулатора. Уклањањем управљајте у Xcode > Settings > Components (Platforms у старијим верзијама Xcode-а). Симулатори које Xcode још може да покрене и њихови подаци не чисте се аутоматски."
          }
        },
        "sr-Latn" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Okruženje operativnog sistema simulatora. Uklanjanjem upravljajte u Xcode > Settings > Components (Platforms u starijim verzijama Xcode-a). Simulatori koje Xcode još može da pokrene i njihovi podaci ne čiste se automatski."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Simulatorns OS-körmiljö. Hantera borttagning i Xcode > Settings > Components (Platforms i äldre Xcode). Simulatorer som Xcode fortfarande kan köra, och deras data, rensas inte automatiskt."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Simülatör işletim sistemi çalışma zamanı. Kaldırmayı Xcode > Ayarlar > Bileşenler’de (eski Xcode’da Platformlar) yönetin. Xcode’un hâlâ çalıştırabildiği simülatörler ve verileri kendiliğinden temizlenmez."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "模拟器操作系统运行时。请在 Xcode > 设置 > 组件（旧版 Xcode 中为“平台”）中管理移除。Xcode 仍可运行的模拟器及其数据不会被自动清理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
