    "node_modules, Rust target and Swift .build folders in projects untouched for 30 days: no commit, no uncommitted change, no running process and no Claude Code or Codex session. Each has a lockfile, so one install rebuilds it. Never selected or scheduled automatically." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
